# Safety

- Never overwrite unrelated user changes.
- Never reset or discard user work to make tests pass.
- No destructive git unless the founder asked.
- No secrets in `.agent-team/`, logs, or reports.
- Do not install packages or change global config without a reason.
- Do not deploy or publish unless asked.
- If the project is outside this workspace, ask for access. Do not pretend you inspected it.
